  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.63,
      "text": "Sam Altman just described the entire premise of a startup collapsing into an afternoon. Listen to the number he uses."
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 7.51,
      "end": 11.79,
      "text": "Three months, down to seven. That isn't a productivity gain. That's the floor moving."
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 12.61,
      "end": 18.35,
      "text": "So the real question isn't whether you can build faster. It's what you'd attempt if building stopped being the hard part."
    }
  ]
}